Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The greatest thief in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.57,0:00:03.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}city was finally caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.43,0:00:05.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}He was putting things back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:06.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}They say it happened in
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.70,0:00:08.07,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}a crooked little town of
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.07,0:00:09.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}chimneys and cobblestones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.13,0:00:11.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Every night,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:12.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}something went missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:13.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}A clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.73,0:00:14.63,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}A kettle.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.63,0:00:16.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}A child's music box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.57,0:00:18.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The mayor lost his favourite chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.13,0:00:20.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}People bolted their doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.97,0:00:22.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}They nailed their windows shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.83,0:00:24.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}One man slept inside
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.03,0:00:25.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}his own cupboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.53,0:00:27.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The guards chased shadows across the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.73,0:00:29.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}rooftops for a whole year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.87,0:00:32.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}But then people noticed something strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.93,0:00:34.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}Everything came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.77,0:00:36.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The clock came back ticking.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.57,0:00:38.67,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The kettle came back whistling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:40.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The music box played a song
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.27,0:00:42.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}it had forgotten years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.40,0:00:43.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}So one night,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.93,0:00:45.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}the captain of the guard hid
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:47.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}in the mayor's house and waited.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:48.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}At midnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.47,0:00:50.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}the window creaked open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:52.17,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}A masked figure climbed in,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:53.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}carrying a chair.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.77,0:00:54.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The whole town came
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.83,0:00:56.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}running with torches.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.53,0:00:57.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}You see,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.03,0:00:58.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}the thief had never
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.10,0:00:59.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}wanted their things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:01.77,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}He only took what was broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.77,0:01:03.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}He carried it home,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}mended it by candlelight,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.53,0:01:06.60,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}and brought it back before morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.60,0:01:08.23,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}And nobody in that town ever
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.23,0:01:10.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}opened the door to a stranger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.53,0:01:12.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The town held a trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.30,0:01:14.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}The verdict took one minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.37,0:01:15.47,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}They sentenced him to a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:17.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}workshop on the main street,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:18.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}with his name above the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.83,0:01:20.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}And he never had to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:22.13,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}steal a broken thing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.13,0:01:23.27,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}People just left them
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.27,0:01:24.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,60)}on his step.
